Package: infereportR
Type: Package
Title: Tables, Text and Plot Annotations for Statistical Results
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", , "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Formats finalized statistical results as tables, text and optional plot annotations. Preserves numerical precision and method metadata without recomputing inference.
